      "edition": "Fr. Luis de Granada, Obras, ed. Justo Cuervo OP, vol. 3 (Madrid: Viuda e hija de Gómez Fuentenebro, 1906-1908). Text of the first edition (Salamanca 1565).",
      "description": "Dedication, preface, prologue and the seven treatises (exhortation to good living, penance, communion, rules of Christian life, vocal prayer, mental prayer with the Vita Christi, love of God), with the three meditations on the Pater noster. Cuervo's apparatus of variants (about 1600 lines) and table are not imported. OCR of the University of Toronto scan, cleaned by script (running heads, page numbers and the editor's prologue removed; lost initial capitals restored from the corpus vocabulary), not proofread.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Granada's text of the 16th century, reprinted in 1906; Cuervo's edition is in the public domain on archive.org."
    }
